Oh ho! With a face like that,
I'll bet you're a Pokémon Trainer!{VAR BE01}
I work as a Depot Agent on the
Battle Subway!{VAR BE01}
Have you tried challenging the
Battle Subway yet?{VAR BE01}
It's a hot spot for those who want
some serious battling action!{VAR BE01}
But some people get too wrapped up
in their battles, and there's no end{VAR BE00}
to the lost-and-found items.{VAR BE01}
That's right. Nobody ever came to
pick this up, so I'll give it to you!{VAR BE01}

I have a lost-and-found item
that no one has claimed.{VAR BE01}
If you don't mind, could you take it
off my hands?{VAR BE01}

Oh! I've been waiting for you!{VAR BE01}
Recently, we've gotten more passengers,
so there's more lost-and-found items!{VAR BE01}
No one has claimed this, so if you don't
mind, could you take it off my hands?{VAR BE01}

No worries. No worries.
Just take it!{VAR BE01}
It's better for a Trainer to use it than
for me to hold on to it.{VAR BE01}
I'm sure the item is happier, too!
